---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';


---

<Layout title="Contact GitSy - Get Support & Feedback" description="Get in touch with the GitSy team for support, feature requests, or general inquiries about the Git-based note synchronization app.">

  
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p class="lead">We'd love to hear from you</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-content">
          <div class="contact-info">
            <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
            <p>
              Whether you need support, have a feature request, or just want to share your 
              feedback about GitSy, we're here to help. Choose the best way to reach us:
            </p>

            <div class="contact-methods">
              <div class="contact-method">
                <div class="method-icon">📧</div>
                <div class="method-content">
                  <h3>Email Support</h3>
                  <p>For technical support and general inquiries</p>
                  <a href="mailto:support@gitsy.de" class="contact-link">support@gitsy.de</a>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="contact-method">
                <div class="method-icon">🐛</div>
                <div class="method-content">
                  <h3>Bug Reports</h3>
                  <p>Found a bug? Report it on our GitHub issues page</p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/maxistar/gitsy/issues" class="contact-link">GitHub Issues</a>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="contact-method">
                <div class="method-icon">💡</div>
                <div class="method-content">
                  <h3>Feature Requests</h3>
                  <p>Have an idea for improving GitSy?</p>
                  <a href="/roadmap" class="contact-link">Roadmap</a>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <div class="response-times">
              <h3>Notes</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Support:</strong> Response times may vary during testing</li>
                <li><strong>Bug reports:</strong> Include Android version, app version, and repository provider</li>
                <li><strong>Feature requests:</strong> Planned work is tracked on the roadmap</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-form-container">
            <div class="contact-form">
              <h2>Email Support</h2>
              <p>There is no website contact form yet. Send support requests by email and include the Android version, app version, repository provider, and a short description of the issue.</p>
              <a href="mailto:support@gitsy.de" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Email support@gitsy.de</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-section">
          <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3>Is GitSy free to use?</h3>
              <p>
                Yes, GitSy is completely free to download and use. You only need a Git repository 
                to store your notes, which you can get for free from GitHub, GitLab, or other providers.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3>Which Git hosting services are supported?</h3>
              <p>
                GitSy supports HTTPS and SSH Git repositories. GitHub, GitLab, and compatible self-hosted
                Git servers are documented targets.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3>Can I use GitSy offline?</h3>
              <p>
                You can edit files in the selected folder with your preferred Android app while offline.
                GitSy synchronizes the folder when you run sync and network access is available.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3>Is my data secure?</h3>
              <p>
                Your notes are stored in your own Git repository, giving you complete control 
              over your data. GitSy doesn't store any of your content on our servers.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3>Can I export my repository?</h3>
              <p>
                GitSy stores your selected folder in a Git repository. You can clone or export that
                repository with standard Git tools.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3>How do I backup my notes?</h3>
              <p>
                Your notes are automatically backed up to your Git repository with full version 
                history. You can also clone your repository to multiple locations for additional backups.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .contact-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .contact-info h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-info > p {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .contact-methods {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .contact-method {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .method-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .method-content h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .method-content p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .contact-link {
    color: #2563eb;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .response-times {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }

  .response-times h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .response-times ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .response-times li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    color: #374151;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .response-times li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .contact-form-container {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-form {
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .contact-form h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-form > p {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .form-group label {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group select,
  .form-group textarea {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group select:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #2563eb;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
  }

  .form-group small {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .form-group textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 120px;
  }

  .faq-section {
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }

  .faq-section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    color: #6b7280;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .contact-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .contact-form {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-methods {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact-method {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .method-icon {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .faq-item {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
